### 提交视频生成任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/video/submitGeekAiVeo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "prompt": "画面：中景，平拍，轻微向上摇摄。女性角色举起右手指向天花板吊灯。保持光线和整体外观与参考帧一致。",
  "modelId": 68,
  "size": "720x1280",
  "seconds": 8,
  "inputReferences": [
    "http://8.148.177.33:48080/admin-api/infra/file/29/get/20260507/1000001919_1778098062789.png"
  ]
}

### 同步视频生成进展
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/video/syncGeekAiVeoVideo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

